{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14551","headline":"晓闻长乐钟声 · 戴叔伦","name":"晓闻长乐钟声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉苑钟声早，秦郊曙色分。\n霜凌万户彻，风散一城闻。\n已啓蓬莱殿，初朝鸳鹭羣。\n虚心方应物，大扣欲干云。\n近杂鸡人唱，新传凫氏文。\n能令翰苑客，流听思氛氲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14551.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14551","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}